OL,3,GNEWSAExtra funding for Home Affairs
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president of Home Affairs has said
OL,7,Fhe was "bitterly disappointed" after
OL,8,Fthree requests for further funding were
OL,9,Frejected.
OL,11,FThe committee had put forward three
OL,12,Famendments to maintain frontline
OL,13,Fservices, protect vulnerable groups and
OL,14,Fsafeguard the economy in the
OL,15,Falternative budgets proposed by Policy
OL,16,F& Resources (P&R), totalling nearly an
OL,17,Fadditional #4m under option A budget
OL,18,Fand nearly #2.3m under option B.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
