OL,3,GNEWSAExtra funding for Home Affairs
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Marc Leadbeater said as a
OL,7,Fconsequence his committee will have to
OL,8,Fmake cuts to keep essential services
OL,9,Frunning.
OL,11,FP&R Vice-President Yvonne Burford said
OL,12,Fthe additional funding requested had
OL,13,Falready been incorporated in Option B
OL,14,Fbudget.
